    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the endlessly looping world of the Internet, hunt down category data.</strong><br>After each successful hunt, absorb the <strong>data source</strong> that appears.<br>It will help restore your unstable code \u2014 or rebirth you as a new, complete form of data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might absorb content-type data like <strong>digital influencers, celebrities, or game characters</strong>,<br>or knowledge-type data such as <strong>critiques and financial info</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607480/extras/470cab85e709485cc2481ece29330e29.avif?t=1748345198\" width=739 height=641 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>six types of data</strong> to absorb.<br>Collect all from one category to unlock a satisfying ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the ending doesn\u2019t please you\u2026<br>You may start over and begin your data collection journey again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607480/extras/af4dc6a870ca7e9b0572a5a16a5335eb.avif?t=1748345198\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t fear the other data-beasts that charge at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your lovely companion, <strong>AI Internet</strong>, will gladly help you again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607480/extras/e02ecec7c2c31939dc87a2733cfa30b8.avif?t=1748345198\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Internet will have items ready at the shop that may help you on your hunt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never forget that AI Internet and you are here to help each other. :)</strong></p>",
